st how long Gamora will remain a  ravager remains to be seen in the first  trailer we were actually able to see her  alongside the Guardians again so it  seems like the old group is coming back  together after all she is also holding a  Polaroid in another scene of course we  assume that it is an old photo of her  and Peter will there be a happy ending  for the two of them after all  in the post-credits scene of the last  movie the adversary of volume 3 was also  introduced there The High Priestess  Ayesha could be seen breeding a new  evolved Sovereign named Adam this atom  is none other than Adam Warlock in the  comics he was brought to life by a group  of researchers who wanted to make the  perfect being in the upcoming film the  role of Adam will be played by Will  Poulter it is likewise confirmed that  Elizabeth Debicki will once again slip  into the role of the high priestess  Ayesha as another antagonist we learned  through Comic-Con that Herbert Edgar  Windham AKA High evolutionary will be  featured he is trying to create a higher  Evolution through genetic experiments  you probably guessed it he is also the  creator of Rocket among the first  published images of the new movie you  can also see a shot of baby rocket  moreover at the start of the trailer the  Guardians land on a planet that is very  similar to Earth where only animal-like  creatures live but which seem to have a  humanoid form comic fans among you may  be eager to learn whether this is an  allusion to the counter Earth which was  created by the high evolutionary  whether Thor will be back for Guardians  volume 3 has not yet been clarified  nevertheless it is likely he will appear  in at least a few sequences after all he  did travel the universe with the  Guardians for a while on the other hand  he is the first hero Adam Warlock meets  in the comics and also an adversary of  high evolutionary but this is of course  still pure speculation and not confirmed  by anybody yet  it was certainly not easy to get to the  start of filming for the third part of  the film series although director James  Gunn confirmed back in March 2017 that  there would be a third part The  Mastermind behind the Guardians first  had to pack his bags after an almost 10  year old tweet of his was made public in  which he made fun of sexual assault  things were over for the time being  since this cannot be reconciled with the  strict guidelines of Disney they felt  compelled to dismiss God only after more  or less the entire star Ensemble of the  Guardians had publicly stood up for the  director did they bring Gunn back to the  project in March 2019 this allowed  production to restart with a  considerable delay the year 2020 was  originally planned as the shooting start  but of course they didn't know  beforehand that everything would turn  out differently that year thus Guardians  of the Galaxy vol 3 had to be added to  the long list of postponements in  addition Chris Hemsworth also expressed  interest in shooting a fourth solo film  around his character of Thor this  production was then promptly given more  attention filming on the Guardians movie  finally began at the end of 2021 the  first trailer was then shown at a press  conference at the San Diego Comic-Con  this was actually only supposed to be  shown to the Press but shortly after the  first mobile phone shots of the trailer  emerged this led to displeasure among  the fans as they have been waiting for  some footage for a long time  thanks to the trailer much is already  known about the plot and so far we can  forecast three major storylines Gunn  himself stated in a podcast that the  third and last part of the Guardians  will probably be the darkest although he  will of course not skimp on humor he  also hinted that not everyone in the  group Will Survive their final battle at  this point we would like to emphasize  that not everything we predict will turn  out that way but rather it seems  realistic to us the search for 