 take revenge on the Guardians of the  Galaxy yeah he may end up taking a  completely different path indeed in the  comics he eventually joins the Guardians  to protect the universe and rebuild it  after a terrible disaster what is clear  here is that in the movie series it  wasn't researchers on Earth who created  Adam Warlock but the Sovereign we  finally got to watch this in the  post-credits scene of Guardians of the  Galaxy Vol 2. they could have been  helped by Edgar Windham AKA High  evolutionary which would make a good  connection between the Guardians and him  the fact that warlock will join the  Guardians at the end of the movie is not  that unrealistic it is clear that they  will have to regroup and as Gunn said  not everyone necessarily has to survive  of course that begs the question who  might die  the most likely scenario for us is the  death of Drex the actress fallen out  with Disney and has long announced that  this will be his final Marvel film well  that makes it very easy to Simply let  the character die besides Drex has  accomplished his great goals and Avenged  his family after the death of Ronan and  Thanos also in the trailer we saw the  Guardians in a prison again and Drex was  dragged Away by Gamora and mantis with a  gunshot wounded to the chest however  further deaths cannot be excluded for  instance Peter could sacrifice himself  for Gamora if she were to be in danger  again also the possibility of Rocket  dying cannot be ruled out indeed James  Gunn stated that he put all of himself  into the role of rocket and thus with  his departure from the franchise his  character could die as well in the lore  Rock and Lila wanted to escape from the  high evolutionary together but  unfortunately Lila didn't make it maybe  rocket will sacrifice himself this time  so that his best friend can live in  Freedom no matter who or whether someone  even dies we will surely have tears  running down our faces with the end of  Guardians of the Galaxy  that was our preview of Guardians of the  Galaxy Vol 3. how do you imagine the  story will play out let us know in the  comments and if you like the video don't  forget to give it a thumbs up see you  next time  [Music]


